(text "PWR: 3V3 present. EN: OUT_OE_N low, output latches enabled.\nPer-host red PWR/RST indicators follow the photorelay driver AND PHOTO_5V.\nThese indicate driver state, NOT actual contact closure or host power state.\nRJ45 built-in LINK/ACT LEDs retained. All indicators use controller ground."(at 12 20 0)(effects(font(size 1.27 1.27))(justify left))(uuid 391d0969-cdb0-56f4-acf5-cb260d279d65))
